        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Make a contest of [DEX+MIG]</p>\n<p>On failed check, Sharodin grab target creature and fly into the air.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The target is instantly inflict by [Grapple] [Doom] [Frightened] [Paralyzed] [Silence] and [Stagger] can't protected by ahother character.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This condition can only end when Sharodin suffered from 3 or more status condition.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "It Must Be Done",
          "roll": ""
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>All creature must success DC12 [MIG+WLP] check or suffered [Shaken] status.</p>\n<p>If the check failed 6 or lower, the target also gain [Frightened] and [Panic]</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "other_name": "Pressure of the King",
          "roll": ""
        },
