        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>When Sharodin take [Earth] damage, [Turbulent Flow] effect is negate and all [Weak] condition from the skill is dispeled until he use action to activate it again.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Redirect Flow"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Sharodin is immune to [Shaken] and [Enrage] status effect.</p>\n<p>The player can spend 1 Fabula Point to say something directly to him that waver his resolve. Disable this feature for the rest of the scene.</p>\n<p>The DM has the final say that your talk succeed or not.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Calm and Cool"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Sharodin deal extra 10 damage from all attack and spell (apply before calculate anything) to the target that suffers from 3 or more status effect.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Banishing the Weak"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Sharodin landing on ground and cover with high wind pressure. Can't be attacked with range weapon.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Reversal Storm"
        },
        "6": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "details": "<p>Sharodin gain [Storm] stack everytime he take non-[Air][Bolt][Earth][Ice][Poison] damage. When stack reach 10, Unleash [Spiral Annihilation] next turn.</p>",
          "icon": "",
          "roll": "",
          "special_name": "Gathering Storm"
